OL,3,AJailed Pakistan ex-PM Imran Khan taken
OL,4,Ato hospital for treatment
OL,5,
OL,6,FKhan has been imprisoned since 2023 on
OL,7,Fcorruption charges, which he says were
OL,8,Fpolitically motivated.
